        "TileImage": "$($repository a7febd58-9136-4f32-ac45-448e1e39b578).Image",
        "Description": "The Ninja Society council has determined that the Hokkaido Hospital DDR machine and those who use it are a risk to the society, apparently due to the appearance of Ninjas and the mention of a society with DDR.\r\rIt doesn&apos;t make much sense to me, but the council&apos;s words are absolute. Deal with the DDR machine, and make sure no mention of the Ninja Society comes out of the Hokkaido hospital again.\r\rGood luck, Ninja.",
